Topic Direction Payload <code>v1/gateway/connect</code> publish <code>{"devices": ["&lt;uuid&gt;", ...]}</code> <code>v1/gateway/disconnect</code> publish <code>{"devices": ["&lt;uuid&gt;", ...]}</code> <code>v1/gateway/manifest</code> publish Full-state reconciliation, every 5 minutes <p>Announce sub-devices in batches when they attach/detach. The manifest is the authoritative periodic full list; the platform reconciles desired vs reported presence from it:</p> <pre><code>{
  "devices": ["&lt;uuid-1&gt;", "&lt;uuid-2&gt;"],
  "connectors": [
    {"spec_id": "ci-...", "revision": 3, "config_hash": "..."}
  ],
  "missed_cycles": 0
}
</code></pre> <ul> <li><code>connectors</code> semantics matter: omit the field to skip connector   reconciliation; send an explicit empty array <code>[]</code> to report "zero   connectors applied".</li> <li>Include all currently attached sub-device UUIDs every time; the manifest   is full-state, not a delta.</li> </ul>

Topic 方向 载荷 <code>v1/gateway/connect</code> 发布 <code>{"devices": ["&lt;uuid&gt;", ...]}</code> <code>v1/gateway/disconnect</code> 发布 <code>{"devices": ["&lt;uuid&gt;", ...]}</code> <code>v1/gateway/manifest</code> 发布 每 5 分钟一次的全量状态对账 <p>子设备挂载/卸载时批量上线下线。manifest 是权威的周期性全量清单，平台据此对账 desired 与 reported presence：</p> <pre><code>{
  "devices": ["&lt;uuid-1&gt;", "&lt;uuid-2&gt;"],
  "connectors": [
    {"spec_id": "ci-...", "revision": 3, "config_hash": "..."}
  ],
  "missed_cycles": 0
}
</code></pre> <ul> <li><code>connectors</code> 字段的存在与否有明确语义：省略该字段表示跳过连接器对账；   显式发送空数组 <code>[]</code> 表示"当前零个连接器实例"。</li> <li>每次都必须列出当前挂载的全部子设备 UUID；manifest 是全量状态，不是增量。</li> </ul>
